  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN OHCHR Uganda 2016 - Extension for 2016 - Support to UN OHCHR 2016 - Extension for 2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to UN OHCHR Uganda 2016 - Extension for 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">N/A- Refer to the Decision on exemption from Sida contribution management rule under DG Decision 2016-000872 as uploaded under saved documents. The exemption is from Sida contribution management rule to allow use of paragraph 3.11.2 for agreement amendments higher than 5 MSEK for decisions on additional support to the UN Office for the High Commissioner for human rights (OHCHR) country programmes in Colombia, Guatemala, Cambodia and Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Intervention will address 5 thematic areas; Widening the democratic space, Strengthening the effectiveness of international human rights mechanisms and the progressive development of international human rights law and standards, Human rights in development and in the economic sphere, Combating impunity and strengthening accountability and the rule of law, Countering discrimination, in particular racial discrimination, discrimination on the grounds of sex, religion and against others who are marginalised.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Intervention will address 5 thematic areas; Widening the democratic space, Strengthening the effectiveness of international human rights mechanisms and the progressive development of international human rights law and standards, Human rights in development and in the economic sphere, Combating impunity and strengthening accountability and the rule of law, Countering discrimination, in particular racial discrimination, discrimination on the grounds of sex, religion and against others who are marginalised.</narrative>
  </description>
